  ($tr$Абзац A содержит личное свидетельство спортсменки: «This is something that British tennis player Emma Raducanu wrote about on social media following her withdrawal from the 2021 Wimbledon tournament». Радукану сама описала своё состояние («the accumulation of the excitement and the buzz») — это и есть «рассказ спортсмена о своём опыте стресса». Дистракторы: в абзаце C о Радукану рассуждает автор (анализ причин), а не сама спортсменка; абзац E вообще без примеров.$tr$, $tr$Paragraph A contains the athlete's own testimony: «This is something that British tennis player Emma Raducanu wrote about on social media following her withdrawal from the 2021 Wimbledon tournament». Raducanu herself described her state («the accumulation of the excitement and the buzz») — this is precisely «an account by an athlete of their experience of stress». Distractors: in paragraph C it is the author, not the athlete herself, who discusses Raducanu (analysing causes); paragraph E contains no examples at all.$tr$),
