  ($tr$Абзац C анализирует случай Радукану: «a much larger audience, higher expectations and facing a more skilful opponent, may all have led her to feel there were greater demands being placed on her at Wimbledon». Большая аудитория, высокие ожидания и более опытная соперница — это «факторы турнира, усилившие стресс», вариант D. Дистракторы: B (симптомы) — из абзаца A (дыхание и пульс); A (этап ухода) и E (реакции на посты) в тексте не упомянуты; C (шаги по управлению стрессом) — материал абзаца F.$tr$, $tr$Paragraph C analyses Raducanu's case: «a much larger audience, higher expectations and facing a more skilful opponent, may all have led her to feel there were greater demands being placed on her at Wimbledon». A larger audience, high expectations and a more experienced opponent are «tournament factors that intensified the stress» — option D. Distractors: B (symptoms) — from paragraph A (breathing and pulse); A (the stage of leaving) and E (responses to posts) are not mentioned in the text; C (steps for managing stress) — the material of paragraph F.$tr$),
